{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Splash—one ring, then two, then three.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Follow the ripples; letters are diving in.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A — Angelfish! Tall fins open wide | gliding through reef water side to side.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B ... B ... Buoy! Bobbing bright, it marks a place where boats can ride.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C is for Coral. Reef rooms grow below | branching shelter, row by row.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D? Dock! A long arm from the shore where boats can pause beside the tide.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Here comes E with Eel. Slip through blue | winding body disappears from view.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F — Fish! Fins steer; gills breathe as water passes through.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G ... G ... Grouper! Round and low | wide mouth waits where reef shadows grow.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H is for Harbor—waves lose their hurry here | sheltered water gives boats a quieter place to rest.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Splash, glide, dive—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Every wave brings a word to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I? Island! Ringed by sand | water wraps around the land.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Here comes J with Jetty—dry land keeps walking | a narrow path reaches out over the water.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "K — Kayak! Paddle the track | forward, turn, and paddle back.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L ... L ... Lobster! Claws out front, it walks the seafloor forward and back.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M is for Mussel. Shell shuts well | two dark halves hold fast below.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N? Narwhal! Arctic whale | one long spiral tusk may grow.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Here comes O with Octopus. Eight arms gather, open | soft body pours through a narrow place.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P — Pelican! Bill dips low | throat pouch scoops a fish with grace.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Q ... Quahog! Hard-shell clam | tucked under coastal sand.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R is for Ray—wide fins wave | gliding low above that sand.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S? Seahorse! Upright swimmer | curled tail holds fast around a plant.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Here comes T with Turtle. Shell rides light | steady strokes beneath it all.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "Splash, glide, dive—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "Every wave brings a word to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "U — Undersea Cave! Under the wave | a deep rocky hollow where dark water stays.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V ... V ... Violet Sea Snail! At the skin of the sea, a tiny purple-blue body floats with the swell.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W is for Whale. Up from blue depth | one giant breath, then the body turns below.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X? X-ray Tetra! Small and translucent; through its body we can partly see.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Here comes Y with Yellowfin Tuna. Yellow fins in view | fast body cutting through the blue.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z — Zooplankton! Tiny drifters ride wherever moving water carries them too.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "The water goes quiet—can the letters swim back?",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "A ... Angelfish! Glide two hands like fins.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "B ... B ... Buoy! Bob one hand gently up and down.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C? ... Coral! Spread fingers like reef branches.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D ... Dock! Stretch one arm straight like a dock.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "E ... Eel! Wiggle one hand in a long curve.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "F ... F ... Fish! Swish one hand like a fish tail.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G? ... Grouper! Make a slow fish-swim with one hand.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Find H ... Harbor! Curve both hands into a safe little bay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "I ... Island! Draw a little circle in the air.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "J ... J ... Jetty! Slide one hand straight out over imaginary water.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "K? ... Kayak! Paddle left, paddle right.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Find L ... Lobster! Make two gentle claw shapes.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "M ... Mussel! Close two palms like a shell.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "N ... N ... Narwhal! Point one finger forward like a tusk, then glide.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "O? ... Octopus! Wiggle your fingers like octopus arms.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Find P ... Pelican! Make one gentle scooping motion.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Splash, glide, dive—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Every wave brings a word to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Quahog! Close both palms like a clam shell.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "R ... R ... Ray! Glide both hands wide like wings.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "S? ... Seahorse! Curl one finger like a seahorse tail.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Find T ... Turtle! Make a shell shape with both hands.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "U ... Undersea Cave! Make a cave arch with both hands.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "V ... V ... Violet Sea Snail! Trace a tiny spiral, then float your hand.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "W? ... Whale! Glide both hands wide, then lift for a breath.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Find X ... X-ray Tetra! Make a gentle fish-swim with one hand.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Y ... Yellowfin Tuna! Make one smooth, speedy fish-swim.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Z ... Z ... Zooplankton! Let fingertips drift slowly with the current.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Splash, glide, dive—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Every wave brings a word to me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "One last ripple rises free.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "A to Z comes home from sea.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
